==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Clefable|82}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*'''Magical Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Ralts|52}} and {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Kirlia|53}}, both from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Clefable}}.

